SUMMARY:Goosebumps The Musical: Phantom of the Auditorium
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261113T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261113T200000
UID:aafba315ec7f7bd8b9f6c7883f0bb231@ipm.org
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims4/default/7138
 c07/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2400x2400+0+0/resize/254x254!/quality/90/?u
 rl=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Ffe%2F47%2F171f49ba45d8be
 4627e8ac726cf0%2Fsq-goosebumps-2.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Presented by Constellation Stage + Screen\nConstellation Stage
  & Screen presents “R.L. Stine's Goosebumps The Musical: Phantom of the 
 Auditorium” on stage October 30-November 15 at the Waldron Auditorium.\n
  Get ready for a frightfully fun adventure with Goosebumps The Musical\, b
 ased on the wildly popular books by R. L. Stine! When Brooke and Zeke are 
 cast in their school’s spooky new play\, The Phantom\, they start to won
 der if the show is actually cursed. As strange messages appear and rehears
 als are disrupted by a mysterious masked figure\, they must uncover the tr
 uth: is it all an elaborate prank… or is their theater truly haunted? Fu
 ll of catchy songs\, laugh-out-loud moments\, and just the right amount of
  Halloween-season chills\, this musical mystery is perfect for kids\, twee
 ns\, and grown-ups who remember reading by flashlight. Fun for all ages! 
 \n See Constellation’s website for more information\, including a detail
 ed performance schedule. Learn more and find tickets at https://seeconstel
 lation.org/kids/goosebumps/\nTickets: https://seeconstellation.org/kids/go
 osebumps/
LOCATION:Waldron Auditorium\, 122 S Walnut St\, Bloomington\, Indiana 4740
 4
URL:https://www.ipm.org/community-calendar/event/goosebumps-the-musical-ph
 antom-of-the-auditorium-24-08-2026-10-36-20
X-SOURCE:WFIU Community Calendar
X-SOURCE-URL:https://www.ipm.org/community-calendar/
END:VEVENT
