DESCRIPTION:Presented by Farmersburg Theater\nOut of Your Senses is an int
 eractive\, narrative haunted escape at our Theater\, that was converted fr
 om an 1890’s church! Out Of Your Senses takes you on a journey\, complet
 e with tasks\, challenges\, and frights….if you can keep your senses abo
 ut you\, that is. Here\, you’re a part of the story and a part of the sc
 ares\, so every night will be an experience unique to you! Theatrical\, fa
 mily friendly\, frightening and fun\, it’s a haunted experience like no 
 other.\nTickets: https://www.farmersburgtheater.org
LOCATION:Farmersburg Theater\, 517 W Main St\, Farmersburg\, Indiana 47850
