DESCRIPTION:Presented by The Waste Reduction District of Monroe County\nAm
 erica Recycles Day is November 15th. Recycling is a daily activity. Are yo
 u recycling? Do you know what is accepted for recycling in your community?
  The Waste Reduction District serves Monroe County by offering 5 drop-off 
 recycling centers\, as well as associated services. With our Green Busines
 s Network program\, we offer a free waste audit. And for a minimal fee\, r
 ecycling pick up. Basic earth stewardship. Recycle right. Rinse\, degrease
 \, and dry. Visit us online\, give us a call\, or stop by one of our cente
 rs. Wastereductiondistrict.com.\n ###
