BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Hope for the Holidays
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261117T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261117T190000
UID:3fd546fc71cc0d5dfe9d6e94d6b1c7e5@ipm.org
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims4/default/c4ec
 9ab/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1250x1250+0+0/resize/254x254!/quality/90/?u
 rl=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F61%2Fa1%2Fe0857bb54ea2a6
 15023170626cd7%2F2026-holidays-instagram.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Presented by New Hope for Families\nA Holiday Tradition with a
  Purpose!\nHope for the Holidays tree festival\nNovember 17–19\, 2026\n4
 :00–7:00 PM daily\nSwitchyard Park Pavilion\nFree to attend and open to 
 the public\nPresented by IU Credit Union\n The holiday season is a time fo
 r traditions\, family\, and coming together as a community. Hope for the H
 olidays is a Bloomington tradition that brings the magic of the season to 
 life while helping fulfill the mission of New Hope for Families: In our co
 mmunity\, no child will sleep outside. Not tonight. Not ever.\n More than 
 50 unique and charming holiday trees will be on display\, decorated by loc
 al businesses\, organizations\, groups and families. The festival is free 
 festive fun for the whole family. For more information\, visit https://www
 .newhopeforfamilies.org/holidays\n Every child deserves a safe place to sl
 eep. Every family deserves a home for the holidays. Join us to celebrate H
 ope for the Holidays!\nTickets: https://www.newhopeforfamilies.org/holiday
 s
LOCATION:Switchyard Park Pavilion\, 1601 S. Rogers St.\, Bloomington\, Ind
 iana 47403
URL:https://www.ipm.org/community-calendar/event/hope-for-the-holidays-05-
 11-2026-11-20-32
X-SOURCE:WFIU Community Calendar
X-SOURCE-URL:https://www.ipm.org/community-calendar/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Hope for the Holidays Tree Festival
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261117T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261117T190000
UID:0fb713c6e69d2e4dfa5becfc44400ba5@ipm.org
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims4/default/5765
 f84/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1920x1005+0+0/resize/254x133!/quality/90/?u
 rl=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F1f%2Fd7%2Fe64562d841fe91
 c7dc36ecd06871%2Fimg-6556.jpeg
DESCRIPTION:Presented by New Hope for Families\nAt New Hope for Families\,
  we believe that every child deserves a safe place to sleep and every fami
 ly deserves a home — and hope — for the holidays! Our annual Hope for 
 the Holidays tree festival helps us keep our promise that no child will sl
 eep outside. Dozens of unique and festive holiday trees decorated by local
  businesses\, organizations\, groups\, and families will be on display and
  available for purchase. Hope for the Holidays is free to attend and open 
 to the public.
LOCATION:Switchyard Park Pavilion\, 1601 S. Rogers St.\, Bloomington\, Ind
 iana 47403
