UID:65bcf3316b91c6b8158bde8ede1e7283@ipm.org
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims4/default/6699
 7e0/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1286x643+0+0/resize/254x127!/quality/90/?ur
 l=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fca%2F04%2Fdd03176f4bca879
 8087061803e30%2Fa-foreigners-journey-to-boston.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Presented by Buskirk-Chumley Theater\nExperience the magic of 
 three legendary bands—Foreigner\, Journey\, and Boston—brought to life
  by a powerhouse tribute group. Fronted by Brandon Miller\, touring guitar
 ist of the Artimus Pyle Band and Rock and Roll Hall of Fame drummer of Lyn
 yrd Skynyrd\, A Foreigner’s Journey to Boston delivers the iconic hits t
 hat defined a generation.\n With a setlist spanning the greatest hits of F
 oreigner\, Journey\, and Boston\, this band brings the energy\, passion\, 
 and nostalgia of classic rock to every performance.\n “Don’t Stop Beli
 eving” — “More Than a Feeling” — “I Wanna Know What Love Is”
  — AND SO MUCH MORE!\nTickets: https://buskirkchumley.org/events/a-forei
 gner-s-journey-to-boston-november-20-2026/#buy
LOCATION:Buskirk-Chumley Theater\, 114 E Kirkwood Ave\, Bloomington\, Indi
 ana 47408
