UID:e6feeeb3aa085aabbe68ba6fcb98e839@ipm.org
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims4/default/9172
 2c1/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2000x1125+0+0/resize/254x143!/quality/90/?u
 rl=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Faf%2F19%2F851ae6734abf99
 1443c35527c6de%2Fjbr-screen-ads.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Presented by Historic Tivoli Theatre\nIt's time to rock around
  the Christmas tree at the Historic Tivoli Theatre!\n Get ready for an eve
 ning of toe-tapping holiday favorites\, rockabilly spirit\, and a whole lo
 t of Christmas cheer with the **Jingle Bell Rockin' Tribute Band!**\n Did 
 you know that the holiday classic "Jingle Bell Rock" was recorded by India
 na's own Bobby Helms in 1957?\n Now\, his musical legacy lives on! This sp
 ecial tribute band features **members of Bobby Helms' own family**\, bring
 ing his music and love of the holidays to life on the Tivoli stage!\n **SU
 NDAY\, NOVEMBER 22**\n**5:00 PM**\n **TICKETS:**\nAdults $10 | Youth $3\n 
 From Christmas classics to rockabilly favorites\, this is one holiday cele
 bration you won't want to miss!\n A special thank you to **Sweet Owen** fo
 r helping bring this festive performance to our community!\n **Gather your
  family\, bring your friends\, and let's JINGLE BELL ROCK the Tivoli!**\n 
 Get your tickets today!\nwww.spencertivoli.org\nTickets: https://tickets3.
 agileticketing.net/websales/pages/info.aspx?evtinfo=1030289~da03b195-1e2d-
 46bb-a430-e3f36d620f85&amp\;
LOCATION:Historic Tivoli Theatre\, 24 N Washington St\, Spencer\, Indiana 
 47460
