 ocks. All the donations will be given out in our community through places 
 like SPIN\, Becky's Place\, Hoosier Uplands\, CORE Nursing Home\, and Agap
 e House. Donations of all sizes are always welcome and needed. You can dro
 p off your donations by the Circulation Desk!
