BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Garlands & Greenery Open House at Wylie House Museum
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261205T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261205T160000
UID:bcf384098af59664c96efe29d2da6f27@ipm.org
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims4/default/2293
 a11/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1667x1667+0+0/resize/254x254!/quality/90/?u
 rl=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F85%2F00%2F393f96a44dd6a2
 3cea0d05d1ba9a%2Fgarlands-and-greenery-livewhale-square.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Presented by Wylie House Museum\nJoin Wylie House Museum for i
 ts festive Garlands & Greenery Open House on Saturday\, December 5\, from 
 10 a.m. to 4 p.m. This free\, drop-in event invites you to experience the 
 museum adorned for the holiday season.\n Wander through the historic house
  at your own pace\, surrounded by fresh greenery and traditional holiday d
 ecorations. Costumed staff will be on hand to welcome you\, share stories
 \, and answer questions.\n Enjoy live music throughout the day\, featuring
  the Dickens Carolers\, IU student musicians and á cappella groups\, and 
 the Horseshoe Bend String Band. In the Museum’s Education Center\, warm 
 up with hot cider and cocoa\, enjoy holiday cookies\, and try your hand at
  family-friendly craft activities.\n Come celebrate the season with music
 \, merriment\, and the timeless beauty of Wylie House Museum! No registrat
 ion required.\n Parking: Designated\, free Wylie House parking spots are l
 ocated behind the museum and education center\, accessible via the alley. 
 Free street parking is located directly in front of the museum on 2nd St. 
 and is permissible on Saturdays in all the area neighborhood residential z
 oned spaces.\n Accessibility: The museum has accessible parking next to th
 e museum’s Morton C. Bradley\, Jr. Education Center\, with a path that l
 eads to a ramp at the back door entrance of the museum. While the historic
  home’s second floor is only accessible by staircase\, digital images an
 d virtual tour options are provided for visitors who cannot visit the seco
 nd floor. Please contact us in advance of your visit to discuss any specif
 ic needs.\n Looking for a fully guided tour of the historic home? Visit Wy
 lie House Museum on Friday\, December 4\; Friday\, December 11\; or Saturd
 ay\, December 12. Free holiday season tours are offered at the top of each
  hour from 10 a.m. to 4 p.m.\, with the final tour beginning at 3 p.m.\nTi
 ckets: https://events.iu.edu/libraries/event/first-thursday-declaration
LOCATION:Wylie House Museum\, 307 E. 2nd St.\, Bloomington\, Indiana 47401
URL:https://www.ipm.org/community-calendar/event/garlands-amp-greenery-ope
 n-house-at-wylie-house-museum-11-11-2026-09-27-35
X-SOURCE:WFIU Community Calendar
X-SOURCE-URL:https://www.ipm.org/community-calendar/
END:VEVENT
