BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Tokyo Godfathers (2003)
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261206T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261206T235900
UID:6f1d17e29028b7bbce076f444277b058@ipm.org
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims4/default/85b0
 2c9/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1920x1080+0+0/resize/254x143!/quality/90/?u
 rl=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F99%2Ff1%2F5e7ab65f49a9b9
 7441201ced2455%2Ftokyogodfathers.png
DESCRIPTION:Presented by Buskirk-Chumley Theater\nFor those who love the B
 CT’s Studio Ghibli series!\n Tokyo Godfathers is a 2003 Japanese animate
 d Christmas tragicomedy adventure film written and directed by Satoshi Kon
 .\n One Christmas Eve\, three homeless people—middle-aged alcoholic Gin
 \, transgender woman Hana\, and teenage runaway Miyuki—discover an aband
 oned newborn while searching through the garbage\, along with a note askin
 g whoever finds the baby to take good care of her and a key leading to a l
 ocker containing a bag holding clues to the parents’ identity. The trio 
 sets out to find the baby’s parents\, and Hana names her Kiyoko\, after 
 the Japanese title of “Silent Night\,” meaning “pure child”.\n Rat
 ed: PG-13\nLength: 1hr 32mins\nFormat: DCP\nTickets: https://buskirkchumle
 y.org/events/tokyo-godfathers-2003-december-6-2026/
LOCATION:Buskirk-Chumley Theater\, 114 E Kirkwood Ave\, Bloomington\, Indi
 ana 47408
URL:https://www.ipm.org/community-calendar/event/tokyo-godfathers-2003-28-
 10-2026-14-13-27
X-SOURCE:WFIU Community Calendar
X-SOURCE-URL:https://www.ipm.org/community-calendar/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:A Christmas Carol - Live on the Tivoli stage
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261206T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261206T210000
UID:d5546fed3a6c439ed33360e649780c4f@ipm.org
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims4/default/c90c
 f73/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2000x1125+0+0/resize/254x143!/quality/90/?u
 rl=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F72%2F0f%2Fe325554e457d80
 cf0a720cb936f9%2Foctaaa-christmas-carol26.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Presented by Historic Tivoli Theatre\nBAH HUMBUG? NOT AT THE T
 IVOLI!**\n The ghosts of Christmas Past\, Present\, and Yet to Come are ma
 king their way to the Historic Tivoli Theatre!\n Get into the holiday spir
 it with a LIVE stage performance of **A CHRISTMAS CAROL**\, presented by t
 he talented Owen County Theatre & Arts Alliance!\n Experience Charles Dick
 ens' timeless tale of Ebenezer Scrooge\, three unforgettable spirits\, and
  the true meaning of Christmas. It's a heartwarming reminder that it's nev
 er too late to change\, show kindness\, and embrace the joy of the season.
 \n **LIVE ON STAGE | DECEMBER 3–6**\n Thursday\, December 3 | 7 PM\nFrid
 ay\, December 4 | 7 PM\nSaturday\, December 5 | 7 PM\nSunday\, December 6 
 | 2 PM\n **TICKETS:**\nAdults $15 | Youth $5\n Gather your family\, invite
  your friends\, and make a little live theatre part of your holiday tradit
 ions!\n **Don't be a Scrooge — get your tickets today!**\n www.spencerti
 voli.org/tickets\nTickets: https://tickets3.agileticketing.net/websales/pa
 ges/info.aspx?evtinfo=1041893~da03b195-1e2d-46bb-a430-e3f36d620f85&amp\;
LOCATION:Historic Tivoli Theatre\, 24 N Washington St\, Spencer\, Indiana 
 47460
