SUMMARY:YMCA Holiday Bazaar
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261207T080000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261207T120000
UID:ed236d7b2b3a4a6fb4512e55b2c38a43@ipm.org
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims4/default/ffc4
 f2d/2147483647/strip/true/crop/612x792+0+0/resize/254x329!/quality/90/?url
 =http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fb3%2F0f%2Fa557e1914a7997d5
 e93312c40e8b%2F2026-holiday-bazaar-flier.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Presented by Monroe County YMCA\n2026 YMCA Holiday Bazaar\nOpe
 n to the Community!\n Browse our YMCA Holiday Bazaar for the perfect hand-
 crafted gifts for your loved ones this holiday season! Hand-knitted and cr
 ocheted items\, such as scarves\, hats\, gloves\, baby items\, stuffed ani
 mals\, blankets\, and more\, will be available for purchase during the baz
 aar at our Southeast Y lobby. You don't need to be a Y member to shop and 
 support!\n Saturday\, Dec. 6: 8:00 am-12:00 pm\nMonday\, Dec. 8: 8:30 am-1
 2:00 pm\nTuesday\, Dec. 9: 8:30 am-12:00 pm \n The Y Service in Friendship
  group lovingly knits\, crochets\, and quilts each piece throughout the ye
 ar and donates all items to the Holiday Bazaar. All proceeds benefit the Y
  for All Scholarship Fund\, which provides financial assistance to those w
 ho need support with a Y membership\nTickets: https://www.monroecountyymca
 .org/events/holiday-bazaar 
LOCATION:Southeast Monroe County YMCA\, 2125 S Highland Ave\, Bloomington
 \, Indiana 47401
URL:https://www.ipm.org/community-calendar/event/ymca-holiday-bazaar-02-11
 -2026-12-26-42
