 d0474a5aa3b7%2Fsst-logo-web-info.png
DESCRIPTION:Presented by WonderLab Science Museum\nScience Story Time is g
 eared toward listeners toddler through early elementary ages. This program
  uses children’s picture books to engage as well as support scientific c
 oncepts and experiments. Young scientists develop literacy and STEM skills
  as well as build vocabulary by actively participating in the hands-on pro
 gram. Activities designed for ages 2-6. All are welcome. Activities vary m
 onthly.\nTickets: https://wonderlab.org/
LOCATION:Wonderlab\, 308 W 4th St\, Bloomington\, Indiana 47401
URL:https://www.ipm.org/community-calendar/event/science-story-time-at-won
 derlab-22-07-2026-13-38-49
X-SOURCE:WFIU Community Calendar
X-SOURCE-URL:https://www.ipm.org/community-calendar/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Curiosity Lab at WonderLab
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261210T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261210T174500
UID:7272d844f44ff7a2310ded2eee17cecc@ipm.org
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims4/default/b1a7
 0e2/2147483647/strip/true/crop/801x801+0+0/resize/254x254!/quality/90/?url
 =http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F62%2F89%2Ff6d444d54138a4b0
 377124b045ba%2Fcl-logo-web-info-2.png
DESCRIPTION:Presented by WonderLab Science Museum\nCuriosity Lab is an aft
 er-school\, free play program for kids ages 6-10 years. Children are invit
 ed to explore\, experiment\, and engage in hands-on sensory activities at 
 their own pace. No instructions\, no pressure—just curiosity-driven play
 . Held in WonderLab (or sometimes outdoors weather permitting)\, the space
  is set up for exploration with a variety of rotating materials and statio
 ns. \n There will be one main activity/installment/manipulative for the mo
 nth that will be brought out every Thursday. This will rotate with the mon
 th and the month's theme.\nTickets: https://wonderlab.org/
LOCATION:Wonderlab\, 308 W 4th St\, Bloomington\, Indiana 47401
URL:https://www.ipm.org/community-calendar/event/curiosity-lab-at-wonderla
 b-22-07-2026-13-42-23
X-SOURCE:WFIU Community Calendar
X-SOURCE-URL:https://www.ipm.org/community-calendar/
END:VEVENT
