BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:“The Nutcracker” by Peter Ilyich Tchaikovsky
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261212T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261212T235900
UID:d88e9ca8a8422f03605fdc4f408dd91c@ipm.org
DESCRIPTION:NATIONAL OVATION\n Viewers across the country applauded this c
 ontemporary take on the classic ballet featuring the iconic score by Peter
  Ilyich Tchaikovsky when the Emmy-nominated production aired nationally on
  American Public Television last season.\n This bold vision from Jacobs fa
 culty choreographer Sasha Janes shattered stereotypes coast to coast while
  telling the story of inquisitive young Marie and the gift she receives fr
 om her mysterious Aunt Drosselmeier\, who encourages her to unlock the pow
 er of her imagination.\n Join Marie on her incredible adventure as she lea
 rns that magic is everywhere—even in a seemingly ordinary wooden nutcrac
 ker.\n Artistic Staff\nChoreographer\nSasha Janes\n Conductor\nArthur Fage
 n\n Set Designer\nThaddeus Strassberger\n Costume Designer\nLinda Pisano\n
  Video Designer\nGreg Emetaz\n Lighting Designer\nDriscoll Otto\n Wig & Ma
 keup Designer\nKarine Ivey\nTickets: https://am.ticketmaster.com/iumac/buy
LOCATION:Musical Arts Center\, 201 S. Eagleson Ave\, Bloomington\, Indiana
  47405
URL:https://www.ipm.org/community-calendar/event/the-nutcracker-by-peter-i
 lyich-tchaikovsky-11-09-2026-15-27-04
X-SOURCE:WFIU Community Calendar
X-SOURCE-URL:https://www.ipm.org/community-calendar/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Children's Nutcracker
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261212T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261212T151500
UID:7e43713ae4a86d900f41a1e609d5d0d6@ipm.org
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims4/default/2ffe
 436/2147483647/strip/true/crop/561x746+0+0/resize/254x338!/quality/90/?url
 =http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F7e%2F88%2F43df94b446a2a9d7
 4e3974837cc2%2F121226-motionarts-nutcracker-photo-1.PNG
DESCRIPTION:Presented by Motion Arts Dance Academy\nJoin MotionArts Dance 
 Academy’s dancers for Bloomington’s own Children’s Nutcracker—a de
 lightful holiday tradition danced by children\, for children and families!
 \n In this enchanting\, slightly abridged version of the beloved Nutcracke
 r Ballet\, Clara’s Christmas takes a magical turn when she receives an e
 xtraordinary gift from her wonderfully quirky uncle: a Nutcracker doll! As
  the clock strikes midnight\, Clara is swept into a world of holiday wonde
 r\, where she and her brave Nutcracker battle the mischievous Mouse King\,
  journey through a glistening winter wonderland of dancing snowflakes\, an
 d discover the spectacular Land of the Sweets. There\, the Sugar Plum Fair
 y reigns over a dazzling celebration of sweets and delights\, brought to l
 ife by her international courtiers.\n But is it truly the magic of the Nut
 cracker that carries Clara on this extraordinary adventure… or is it all
  just a dream?\n Use code CHILD to recieve a $4 discount on tickets for ch
 ildren 6 and under. Code can be applied to 1 ticket per transaction. Child
 ren 2 and younder who do not need their own seat do not need a ticket.\nTi
 ckets: https://buskirkchumley.org/events/the-children-s-nutcracker-decembe
 r-12-2026/
LOCATION:Buskirk-Chumley Theater\, 114 E Kirkwood Ave\, Bloomington\, Indi
 ana 47408
URL:https://www.ipm.org/community-calendar/event/the-childrens-nutcracker-
 30-10-2026-12-15-23
X-SOURCE:WFIU Community Calendar
X-SOURCE-URL:https://www.ipm.org/community-calendar/
END:VEVENT
