 4d3934e89492%2Fstemsat-logo-web-info-2.png
DESCRIPTION:Presented by WonderLab Science Museum\nEach week\, STEM Saturd
 ay invites kids and caregivers to explore science\, technology\, engineeri
 ng\, and math through hands-on fun that sparks curiosity and creativity—
 turning learning into a true adventure.\nFirst Saturday of the month\, S f
 or Science. \nSecond Saturday of the month\, T for Technology\nThird Satur
 day of the month\, E for Engineering\nFourth Saturday of the month\, M for
  Math\nAny fifth Saturday of a month is\, M for Maker\nTickets: https://wo
 nderlab.org/
LOCATION:Wonderlab\, 308 W 4th St\, Bloomington\, Indiana 47401
