 377124b045ba%2Fcl-logo-web-info-2.png
DESCRIPTION:Presented by WonderLab Science Museum\nCuriosity Lab is an aft
 er-school\, free play program for kids ages 6-10 years. Children are invit
 ed to explore\, experiment\, and engage in hands-on sensory activities at 
 their own pace. No instructions\, no pressure—just curiosity-driven play
 . Held in WonderLab (or sometimes outdoors weather permitting)\, the space
  is set up for exploration with a variety of rotating materials and statio
 ns. \n There will be one main activity/installment/manipulative for the mo
 nth that will be brought out every Thursday. This will rotate with the mon
 th and the month's theme.\nTickets: https://wonderlab.org/
