BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The ConstelLate Show: Holiday Special
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261220T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261220T210000
UID:a776acbe214050cc8f98e27908a7b1e5@ipm.org
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims4/default/7272
 c23/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2400x2400+0+0/resize/254x254!/quality/90/?u
 rl=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F3f%2F3f%2F27125f254767af
 7ad40a2b9f3d27%2Fsq-clate-show-4.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Presented by Constellation Stage + Screen\nConstellation Stage
  & Screen presents “The ConstelLate Show: Holiday Special” on stage De
 cember 17-27 at the Waldron Firebay.\n The ConstelLate Show is Constellati
 on’s very own late-night holiday special—part talk show\, part variety
  show\, and completely one-of-a-kind. Running throughout the holidays with
  brand-new guests each night\, this festive evening brings together local 
 luminaries\, performers\, and personalities. Each episode features intervi
 ews\, games\, live music\, comedy\, surprise talents\, and a few unexpecte
 d twists. Complete with cameras and live monitors\, audiences won’t just
  watch the show—they’ll feel like they’re part of the broadcast. It
 ’s joyful\, it’s unpredictable\, and it’s the most Constellation way
  imaginable to celebrate the season.\n See Constellation’s website for m
 ore information\, including a detailed performance schedule. Learn more an
 d find tickets at https://seeconstellation.org/event/constellate-show/\nTi
 ckets: https://seeconstellation.org/event/constellate-show/
LOCATION:Waldron Firebay Theater\, 122 S. Walnut St.\, Bloomington\, India
 na 47404
URL:https://www.ipm.org/community-calendar/event/the-constellate-show-holi
 day-special-24-08-2026-10-51-04
X-SOURCE:WFIU Community Calendar
X-SOURCE-URL:https://www.ipm.org/community-calendar/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Annie
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261220T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261220T213000
UID:9c13d092168875171e9d4259046660f5@ipm.org
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims4/default/0c3f
 020/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2400x2400+0+0/resize/254x254!/quality/90/?u
 rl=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F21%2F3f%2F296d13f549fbb6
 188dda92a02113%2Fsq-annie-4.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Presented by Constellation Stage + Screen\nConstellation Stage
  & Screen presents “Annie” on stage December 10\, 2026 - January 3\, 2
 027 at the Waldron Auditorium.\n Discover the magic of Annie\, the iconic 
 Broadway musical that has captured hearts for generations! The timeless ta
 le of Little Orphan Annie follows a tenacious young girl whose unbreakable
  optimism leads her on an unforgettable journey from a New York City orpha
 nage to a place she can finally call home. Featuring one of Broadway’s m
 ost memorable scores\, including “It’s the Hard-Knock Life\,” “Eas
 y Street\,” “N.Y.C.” and the endlessly-uplifting “Tomorrow\,” An
 nie is a delightful theatrical experience for the entire family. \n See Co
 nstellation’s website for more information\, including a detailed perfor
 mance schedule. Learn more and find tickets at https://seeconstellation.or
 g/kids/annie/\nTickets: https://seeconstellation.org/kids/annie/
LOCATION:Waldron Auditorium\, 122 S Walnut St\, Bloomington\, Indiana 4740
 4
URL:https://www.ipm.org/community-calendar/event/annie-24-08-2026-10-39-57
X-SOURCE:WFIU Community Calendar
X-SOURCE-URL:https://www.ipm.org/community-calendar/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Miracle on 34th Street (1947)
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261220T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261220T235900
UID:8adb07cfa16c383d1f3f943ca64892a9@ipm.org
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims4/default/c4bb
 777/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1920x1080+0+0/resize/254x143!/quality/90/?u
 rl=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F70%2F8b%2Fda4f670741c193
 bde0152cb532d2%2Fmiracleon34th.png
DESCRIPTION:Presented by Buskirk-Chumley Theater\nIn this Christmas classi
 c\, an old man going by the name of Kris Kringle (Edmund Gwenn) fills in f
 or an intoxicated Santa in Macy’s annual Thanksgiving Day parade. Kringl
 e proves to be such a hit that he is soon appearing regularly at the chain
 ’s main store in midtown Manhattan. When Kringle surprises customers and
  employees alike by claiming that he really is Santa Claus\, it leads to a
  court case to determine his mental health and\, more importantly\, his au
 thenticity.\n Miracle on 34th Street won three Academy Awards and in 2005
 \, the film was selected for preservation in the United States National Fi
 lm Registry by the Library of Congress as being “culturally\, historical
 ly or aesthetically significant.”\n Rated: For Everyone\nLength: 1hr 41m
 ins\nFormat: DCP\nTickets: https://buskirkchumley.org/events/miracle-on-34
 th-street-1947-december-20-2026/
LOCATION:Buskirk-Chumley Theater\, 114 E Kirkwood Ave\, Bloomington\, Indi
 ana 47408
URL:https://www.ipm.org/community-calendar/event/miracle-on-34th-street-19
 47-29-10-2026-15-02-46
X-SOURCE:WFIU Community Calendar
X-SOURCE-URL:https://www.ipm.org/community-calendar/
END:VEVENT
