DESCRIPTION:Presented by Constellation Stage + Screen\nConstellation Stage
  & Screen presents “An Enemy of the People” on stage February 4-21\, 2
 027 at the Waldron Auditorium.\n This Tony-nominated adaptation of Henrik 
 Ibsen’s masterpiece follows a small-town doctor who discovers a catastro
 phe that risks the lives of everyone in town. After raising the alarm\, he
  is shaken to his core as those in power\, including his own brother\, not
  only try to silence him—they try to destroy him.\n See Constellation’
 s website for more information\, including a detailed performance schedule
 . Learn more and find tickets at https://seeconstellation.org/mainstage/en
 emy-of-the-people/\nTickets: https://seeconstellation.org/mainstage/enemy-
 of-the-people/
